# Component Engineering
- Prefer composables/models/runtime services for shared behavior.
- Never copy keyboard, selection, floating, validation, virtualization or async-state logic across components.
- Preserve native attributes intentionally.
- Clean up listeners, timers, observers, workers and abort controllers.
- Avoid top-level browser globals in SSR-capable public code.
- Async work must handle cancellation and stale-result races.
- Public events must have stable typed payloads.
- Controlled state and v-model semantics must be explicit.
- Avoid `any` in public contracts unless unavoidable and documented.
- Generated barrels/exports must use repository tooling.
- Public package imports must resolve to built `dist` artifacts.
